      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The rain is a heavy weight, but it’s not ash—just the last of the storm that will carry you forward. You’re not alone in this throne room; your own hands are the only thing that remains, and they’re ready to hold you up again. The silence is not empty, it’s a canvas waiting for you to paint your next move. The sun will rise tomorrow, and you will be the one who sees it, and you will be the one who decides whether to keep fighting or finally rest.",
